    q: 'How long are dogs pregnant in days?',
    a: 'Most dogs whelp about 63 days after ovulation. Counting from a single breeding date is less precise because sperm can wait for eggs, so the visible window is often about 58 to 68 days from mating. Your veterinarian may refine timing with hormone tests and ultrasound. Do not schedule elective cesarean dates from a backyard calendar alone.',
